ROW: SlotsMatchMembership
FILE: src/lattice/Views/AggregationApplier.cs
DETECTORS: AggregationMembershipAtomicityTests.ApplyAsync_regroup_retract_and_lost_response_keep_membership_atomic, MaterialisedViewNumericCompanionTests.Count_and_sum_follow_create_update_regroup_filter_exit_and_delete_exactly
SUMMARY: the prior member's numeric is not subtracted from its slot

--- FIND
            oldRow = new AccumulatorRow(current.Count - 1, current.Sum - old.Numeric);
--- REPLACE
